  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engagement and analyses for scaling Watershed Investment programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the assignment is to mobilise sustainable finance to scale Watershed Investment Programs (WIPs). This includes the development of scalable WIPs, validate the interest in a WADI platform among all stakeholders, WADI platform development, and consortium building to establish such platform. The partners involved in this program intend to contribute to the programme, internalise lessons learned from the programme within their own organisational strategies and partner in approaches for future scaling.</narrative>
  </description>
